  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Voices are Stopping Violence!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Voices are Stopping Violence. And yours? At Amextra, we will improve the lives of over 100 Tzeltal indigenous women and children in Chiapas, Mexico by reducing violence and overcoming shame and stigma. In this project, men and women will speak about shameful subjects like violence, underage marriage, and reproductive health through the narrative of the lives of story characters, whose experiences mirror their own.</narrative>
  </description>
